autowhisper (0.2.1-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Fix: support nvidia drivers 535-580 including -open variants
  * Fix: exclude pip-only packages from apt dependencies (torch, faster-whisper, etc.)
  * Feature: replace append_newline with ending_action option
  * ending_action supports: "none", "newline", "return_key" (sends Enter keypress)

 -- AutoWhisper Contributors <autowhisper@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 02 Feb 2026 00:00:00 +0000

autowhisper (0.2.0-1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Settings UI expansion: expose all TOML config options
  * Add tabbed interface (General/Advanced tabs)
  * Model settings: size, device, compute type, beam size, language, threads
  * Audio settings: VAD, threshold, silence duration, max duration
  * Hotkeys settings: mode (push-to-talk/toggle), escape to cancel
  * Output settings: method, auto-paste, paste delay, newline, lowercase
  * Feedback settings: frequencies, duration, volume
  * Collapsible Advanced sections per category
  * Dynamic dialog resize when expanders toggle

